# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

This project follows the Keep a Changelog format.

## [0.1.0-pre-2] - 2026-06-06

### Added

- Integrated FreeRTOS for task management and scheduling
- Monitored system health using the internal temperature sensor
- Received and parsed NMEA messages from the NEO-6M GPS module
- Extracted GPS information and transmitted it via GSM or GPRS protocol (requires testing)
- Switched system clock from HSI 8 MHz to 72 MHz using HSE 8 MHz with PLL

### Fixed

- Synchronization issue between UART3 ISR and the NMEA parser function
- Synchronization issue between DMA write buffer and UART3 idle line detection
- Reconfigured TIM3 and ADC to operate correctly with the new 72 MHz system clock

### Notes

This is a bare-metal pre-release intended for hardware validation and low-level protocol testing.
If the APIs and communication layers behave as expected, this will serve as the foundation for the first stable release.

---

## [0.1.0-pre] - 2026-05-17

### Added

- Peripheral-specific API layer for hardware abstraction
- Logging subsystem using USART-based `printf` output
- System health monitoring using internal temperature sensor
- ADC analog watchdog (AWD) support for threshold monitoring

### Notes

This is a bare-metal pre-release intended for hardware validation and low-level protocol testing.
If the APIs and communication layers behave as expected, this will serve as the foundation for the first stable release.

---

